Here's the problem file for the task of putting the vase on the dining table:

```pddl
(define (problem put_vase_on_table)
  (:domain robot2)
  (:objects
    robot2 - robot
    Vase - object
    DiningTable - object
    Shelf - object
  )
  (:init
    (not (inaction robot2))
    (at robot2 Shelf)
    (at-location Vase Shelf)
    (at-location DiningTable Floor)
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (at-location Vase DiningTable)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.